    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88290" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπέρῠσι</span></b> , before a vowel <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπέρι-σιν</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>two years ago,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				272b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.33
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				33.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PThead.</u>
				16.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				9.4
			</span></i>, etc.: but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωπέρυσιν</span></b>  is 
				Att.
			 acc. to <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				166.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.105
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>, and is required by the metre in <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				182
			</span></i>.</div>
